      "studyDesign": "Healthy non-carrier subjects (HC) and asymptomatic PSEN1-E280A mutation carriers (ACr) were compared using a sample enrichment framework combining signal preprocessing (PREP + wavelet-ICA), feature extraction, data harmonization (neuroHarmonize/ComBat), and Propensity Score Matching (PSM) at 2:1, 5:1, and 10:1 HC:ACr ratios. Classification was performed using decision tree models with 10-fold cross-validation.",
